url: >-
  https://github.com/kefyusuf/claimbridge-laravel-client
abstract: >-
  Laravel-ready PHP client for the claimbridge MEDULA-compatible
  claim flow. Loads the guide-verified spec bundle, validates
  outgoing payloads against DVO/enum contracts client-side, and
  returns sandbox-verbatim result contracts. No live SGK
  connection and no real patient data.
keywords:
  - medula
  - sgk
  - healthcare
  - claims
